  "b4381f022f": "Names of Countries",
  "3a216e12c3": "These are preceded by the carrier stem form *wusuḑca* (meaning approximately ‘land/country of [the] ...’), or if the context makes clear that a country is being spoken of, or if the speaker knows the audience is familiar with the name as being a country, then simply *wusa*.",
